<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-TOP 10 QUALIFIERS FOR CLEVELAND CART RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-TOP 10 QUALIFIERS FOR CLEVELAND CART RACE.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten qualifiers for</p>
<p>Sunday's Cleveland GP CART Race after qualifying on Saturday</p>
<p>(tabulate by driver, country, chassis, motor, lap time):</p>
<p>1. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy) Reynard Honda, 56.984 seconds</p>
<p>(133.048 mph/214.114 kph)</p>
<p>2. Gil de Ferran (Brazil) Reynard Honda, 57.514</p>
<p>3. Mark Brundell (U.K.) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 57.538</p>
<p>4. Michael Andretti (U.S.) Swift Ford, 57.637</p>
<p>5. Christian Fittipaldi (Brazil) Swift, 57.764</p>
<p>6. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 57.791</p>
<p>7. Bryan Herta (U.S.) Reynard Ford, 57.803</p>
<p>8. Andre Ribeiro (Brazil) Reynard Honda, 57.921</p>
<p>9. Bobby Rahal (U.S.) Reynard Ford, 57.975</p>
<p>10. Paul Tracy (Canada) Penske Mercedes-Benz, 57.981</p>
</text>
